    {
      "type": "appStoreVersionLocalizations",
      "id": "952a079e-1db9-4ecd-bf5d-d1a554d305f4",
      "attributes": {
        "description": "Make room for quiet.\nYou do not have to wait for free time to rest.\n\nYixiu is your everyday rest and sound companion. At lunch, when awake at night, or between tasks, take a small pause with nature sounds and gentle music. No experience, courses or streaks required.\n\nSTART WITH THE MOMENT YOU HAVE\nA lunch break: choose 15 minutes with peaceful lake sounds in Focus.\nAwake at night: listen to 15 minutes of soft rain at the window. There is nothing you have to finish.\nBetween tasks: take one free minute to follow your breath.\nAll three shortcuts are free. Follow your breath or just listen, and stop whenever you like. The Sounds home stays an uncluttered, immersive player.\n\n27 SOUNDS FREE TO ENJOY\nThe complete library has 54 sounds: 14 nature scenes, 20 classical works, 10 AI-assisted originals and 10 other meditation and ambient tracks.\nEnjoy 10 nature scenes, 10 classical works, five AI-assisted originals, Oasis Rest and First Breath for free.\nListen to waves, rain on eaves, streams and birds, or music by Debussy, Satie, Bach and Beethoven. The Ten Quiet Moments originals are created for Yixiu with AI assistance, each paired with its own landscape. Recording credits and licenses are available in the app.\n\nKEEP YOUR OWN RHYTHM\nNo account. No ads. Free 5, 15 and 30-minute listening timers and a one-minute breathing practice. Enable background playback to keep listening with your screen locked or while using another app.\nFind sounds with purpose and type filters, search, Free, Favorites and Recent. Return to continued listening and favorite sounds under Me. Completed practice records stay on this device, with no targets or streaks to maintain.\n\nMORE ROOM WITH YIXIU PLUS\nPlus offers the full sound library, 60-minute and unlimited listening, and 3, 5 and 10-minute breathing sessions. Restore Purchases is supported. Verified owners of version 1.2 or earlier keep access to the original 14 nature sounds.\nFree content does not require a subscription. Apple shows the price and any eligible offer before purchase.\n\nSHARE A QUIET MOMENT\nCreate a scene poster with a QR code and send it through the system share sheet. Switch between English and Chinese. Made for iPhone and iPad.\n\nYOUR DATA, YOUR CHOICE\nPreferences and practice records stay on your device. Usage analytics is off by default and can be enabled or withdrawn under Me. Journal notes are not uploaded, and analytics is not used for advertising tracking.\n\nSubscriptions renew automatically through Apple. Manage or cancel in system Settings.\nPrivacy: https://yixiu.wonderelian.com/privacy.html\nTerms (Apple Standard EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/",
        "locale": "en-US",
        "keywords": "white,noise,meditation,rain,ocean,nap,break,relax,focus,classical,music,timer,nature,breathing",
        "marketingUrl": "https://yixiu.wonderelian.com/",
        "promotionalText": "You do not have to wait for free time to rest. Take a lunch break, listen when awake at night, or breathe for one minute. 27 sounds free. No account, ads or streaks.",
        "supportUrl": "https://yixiu.wonderelian.com/",
        "whatsNew": "Make room for quiet.\n\n• Three free Focus shortcuts: a 15-minute lunch break, nighttime listening and one minute of breathing. The Sounds home stays uncluttered.\n• Filter by purpose and sound type alongside search, Free, Favorites and Recent.\n• Start listening while purchase access is checked in the background, then apply verified access.\n• More balanced levels across the ten AI-assisted originals, preserving their gentle dynamics.\n• Refined amber membership gems, bilingual navigation and clearer Favorites. Philosophy and Lifestyle are directly visible.\n\nExisting free content, subscription prices and privacy choices remain unchanged."
      },
